{
  "manifest": 1,
  "id": "news",
  "package": "kiosko-plugin-news",
  "name": {
    "en": "News",
    "es": "Noticias",
    "zh-Hant": "新聞",
    "zh-Hans": "新闻"
  },
  "version": "0.2.2",
  "description": {
    "en": "Press headlines from RSS feeds with their photos. No keys and no AI: consensus across outlets measured with plain set overlap.",
    "es": "Titulares de prensa de los RSS con su foto. Sin claves ni IA: el consenso entre cabeceras se mide con solapamiento de términos.",
    "zh-Hant": "來自 RSS 訂閱源的新聞標題與照片。不需金鑰也不用 AI：各家媒體間的共識以簡單的詞彙重疊來衡量。",
    "zh-Hans": "来自 RSS 订阅源的新闻标题和照片。无需密钥也不用 AI：各家媒体之间的共识用简单的词汇重叠来衡量。"
  },
  "author": "Kiosko",
  "license": "MIT",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/kiosko-lcd/kiosko-plugin-news#readme",
  "repository": "https://github.com/kiosko-lcd/kiosko-plugin-news.git",
  "icon": "newspaper",
  "sdk": "^0.2.0",
  "platforms": [
    "linux",
    "darwin",
    "win32"
  ],
  "languages": [
    "en",
    "es",
    "zh-Hant",
    "zh-Hans"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "info"
  ],
  "tags": [
    "news",
    "noticias",
    "rss",
    "press",
    "prensa"
  ],
  "permissions": {
    "network": [
      "user"
    ]
  },
  "riskyOptions": [
    {
      "path": "news/deck: feeds[].url",
      "risk": [
        "network"
      ],
      "secret": false
    }
  ],
  "requires": [],
  "optional": [
    {
      "type": "weather/current",
      "plugin": "weather"
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "type": "news/headline",
      "name": {
        "en": "Headline",
        "es": "Titular",
        "zh-Hant": "頭條",
        "zh-Hans": "头条"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "One story at a time over its photo, full-bleed: outlet, age, how many outlets carry it, headline and standfirst. With two versions of the same fact side by side when outlets tell it differently.",
        "es": "Una noticia cada vez sobre su foto a sangre: cabecera, antigüedad, cuántas cabeceras la llevan, titular y entradilla. Con dos versiones del mismo hecho lado a lado cuando las cabeceras lo cuentan distinto.",
        "zh-Hant": "一次一則新聞，滿版疊在照片上：媒體、時間、幾家媒體報導、標題與導言。各家媒體說法不同時，會並排顯示同一件事的兩個版本。",
        "zh-Hans": "一次一条新闻，满版叠加在照片上：媒体、时间、几家媒体报道、标题和导语。各家媒体说法不同时，会并排显示同一件事的两个版本。"
      },
      "icon": "newspaper",
      "category": "info",
      "tags": [
        "news",
        "noticias",
        "rss",
        "press",
        "prensa"
      ],
      "size": {
        "min": {
          "w": 480,
          "h": 200
        },
        "preferred": {
          "w": 1920,
          "h": 462
        }
      },
      "chrome": "bare",
      "sources": [
        "news/deck",
        "weather/current"
      ],
      "options": {
        "default": {
          "rotateMs": 30000,
          "outlets": [],
          "showStandfirst": true,
          "offset": 0,
          "showContrast": true,
          "showCorner": true
        },
        "x-ui": {},
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "rotateMs": {
            "title": "Each story for",
            "default": 30000,
            "x-ui": {
              "label": {
                "en": "Each story for",
                "es": "Cada noticia durante",
                "zh-Hant": "每則新聞顯示",
                "zh-Hans": "每条新闻显示"
              },
              "unit": "ms"
            },
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 10000,
            "maximum": 3600000
          },
          "outlets": {
            "title": "Outlets",
            "description": "Empty: all. Feed names as in the news source (El País, Xataka IA…), comma-separated; * matches anything, a leading ! leaves out. A story carried by several shows the version of one of these.",
            "default": [],
            "x-ui": {
              "label": {
                "en": "Outlets",
                "es": "Cabeceras",
                "zh-Hant": "媒體",
                "zh-Hans": "媒体"
              },
              "help": {
                "en": "Empty: all. Feed names as in the news source (El País, Xataka IA…), comma-separated; * matches anything, a leading ! leaves out. A story carried by several shows the version of one of these.",
                "es": "Vacío: todas. Nombres de fuente como en el mazo de noticias (El País, Xataka IA…), separados por comas; * vale por cualquier cosa y un ! delante excluye. De una historia de varias se ve la versión de una de estas.",
                "zh-Hant": "留空：全部。填入新聞來源中的訂閱源名稱（El País、Xataka IA…），以逗號分隔；* 可比對任何內容，開頭加 ! 表示排除。多家媒體報導的新聞會顯示其中一家的版本。",
                "zh-Hans": "留空：全部。填写新闻数据源中的订阅源名称（El País、Xataka IA…），用逗号分隔；* 匹配任意内容，开头加 ! 表示排除。多家媒体报道的新闻会显示其中一家的版本。"
              },
              "widget": "filter",
              "choices": {
                "source": "news/deck",
                "list": "outlets"
              }
            },
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "default": "",
              "x-ui": {
                "placeholder": "name, group/*, !old-*",
                "choices": {
                  "source": "news/deck",
                  "list": "outlets"
                }
              },
              "type": "string"
            },
            "x-filter": true
          },
          "showStandfirst": {
            "title": "Standfirst",
            "description": "The summary under the headline. Off: the headline alone, with room for longer ones.",
            "default": true,
            "x-ui": {
              "label": {
                "en": "Standfirst",
                "es": "Entradilla",
                "zh-Hant": "導言",
                "zh-Hans": "导语"
              },
              "help": {
                "en": "The summary under the headline. Off: the headline alone, with room for longer ones.",
                "es": "El resumen bajo el titular. Apagado: el titular solo, con sitio para los largos.",
                "zh-Hant": "標題下方的摘要。關閉：只顯示標題，可容納較長的標題。",
                "zh-Hans": "标题下方的摘要。关闭：只显示标题，可容纳较长的标题。"
              }
            },
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "offset": {
            "title": "Skip stories",
            "description": "So two news widgets on one screen don't show the same story.",
            "default": 0,
            "x-ui": {
              "label": {
                "en": "Skip stories",
                "es": "Saltar noticias",
                "zh-Hant": "略過新聞",
                "zh-Hans": "跳过新闻"
              },
              "help": {
                "en": "So two news widgets on one screen don't show the same story.",
                "es": "Para que dos widgets de noticias en una pantalla no enseñen la misma.",
                "zh-Hant": "讓同一螢幕上的兩個新聞小工具不會顯示同一則新聞。",
                "zh-Hans": "让同一屏幕上的两个新闻小组件不会显示同一条新闻。"
              },
              "advanced": true
            },
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 50
          },
          "showContrast": {
            "title": "Two versions side by side",
            "description": "On wide tiles, when two outlets tell the same fact differently.",
            "default": true,
            "x-ui": {
              "label": {
                "en": "Two versions side by side",
                "es": "Dos versiones lado a lado",
                "zh-Hant": "兩個版本並排",
                "zh-Hans": "两个版本并排"
              },
              "help": {
                "en": "On wide tiles, when two outlets tell the same fact differently.",
                "es": "En teselas anchas, cuando dos cabeceras cuentan el mismo hecho de forma distinta.",
                "zh-Hant": "用於寬方格，當兩家媒體對同一件事說法不同時。",
                "zh-Hans": "用于宽格子，当两家媒体对同一件事说法不同时。"
              }
            },
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "showCorner": {
            "title": "Clock and weather",
            "default": true,
            "x-ui": {
              "label": {
                "en": "Clock and weather",
                "es": "Reloj y tiempo",
                "zh-Hant": "時鐘與天氣",
                "zh-Hans": "时钟和天气"
              }
            },
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        }
      },
      "screenshot": "docs/headline.png",
      "animated": false,
      "urgent": false
    },
    {
      "type": "news/column",
      "name": {
        "en": "News column",
        "es": "Columna de noticias",
        "zh-Hant": "新聞直欄",
        "zh-Hans": "新闻竖栏"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The current story in a column for a shared screen: photo with rounded corners, clock and temperature on top, headline and standfirst below.",
        "es": "La noticia del momento en una columna para una pantalla compartida: foto con esquinas redondeadas, reloj y temperatura arriba, titular y entradilla abajo.",
        "zh-Hant": "在共用螢幕上以直欄顯示目前的新聞：圓角照片，上方是時鐘與溫度，下方是標題與導言。",
        "zh-Hans": "在共享屏幕上以竖栏显示当前新闻：圆角照片，上方是时钟和温度，下方是标题和导语。"
      },
      "icon": "newspaper",
      "category": "info",
      "tags": [
        "news",
        "noticias",
        "rss"
      ],
      "size": {
        "min": {
          "w": 240,
          "h": 240
        },
        "preferred": {
          "w": 600,
          "h": 462
        }
      },
      "chrome": "bare",
      "sources": [
        "news/deck",
        "weather/current"
      ],
      "options": {
        "default": {
          "rotateMs": 30000,
          "outlets": [],
          "showStandfirst": true,
          "offset": 1,
          "showCorner": true
        },
        "x-ui": {},
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "rotateMs": {
            "title": "Each story for",
            "default": 30000,
            "x-ui": {
              "label": {
                "en": "Each story for",
                "es": "Cada noticia durante",
                "zh-Hant": "每則新聞顯示",
                "zh-Hans": "每条新闻显示"
              },
              "unit": "ms"
            },
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 10000,
            "maximum": 3600000
          },
          "outlets": {
